    (property "Note" "SOLDERED TO THE MAIN BOARD, no socket (case 1351-01 is surface mount). Pin 2 VS, pin 3 GND, pin 4 VOUT; pins 1 and 5-8 are N/C and carry no net (Style 2 - breath-sense-link.md, Mounting). P1 takes the breath tube with its PTFE plug and its <=1 mL trap; P2 IS OPEN TO THE CAVITY AND MUST NEVER BE BLOCKED. Neither is a net, so neither is here - which is exactly the kind of fact a netlist cannot carry and the page must" (at 76.2 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "Pins_source" "datasheets/analog/MPXV4006DP.pdf, case 1351-01 Style 2: pin 2 VS, 3 GND, 4 VOUT, 1 and 5-8 N/C - the same 8-lead pinout as KiCad's MPXA6115A" (at 76.2 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
