  (text "The instrument end of the breath link: every part here is on the main board. The umbilical conductors BREATH_SENSE and AGND_SENSE continue on interfaces/spi-link (J-UMB pins 1 and 2);\nthe module end (R-SER-BREATH, the in-amp) is module/breath-receive-stage. Which board carries which part: breath-sense-link.md, 'Which board places what'." (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 64e48202-cd32-5d2a-8077-cc515e104fd0))
  (text "FROM THE HAND-WRITTEN NETLIST THIS SHEET REPLACES (the part notes are on each part's Note field):\n\nAUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. THE DRAWING IS ON ANOTHER PAGE - carrier.md §2 - and the module half of this link is\ndrawn again on module/breath-receive-stage, which declares these same parts `foreign:` because the pole and the CMRR\nbudget are derived there.\n\nR-SER-BREATH IS NOT HERE. The 10k 0.1% pair is the MODULE-side series protection and module/breath-receive-stage places\nit; this circuit's rows are the instrument-side 1k pair and the sensor." (at 25.4 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3e3a73bf-6129-5e08-961e-e79a996a16cb))
